      "text": "After I found him feeding you."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.0,
      "end": 38.0,
      "text": "Oh my gosh."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.0,
      "end": 39.0,
      "text": "Let that go."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.0,
      "end": 40.0,
      "text": "That was literally years ago."
    },
    {
      "start": 40.0,
      "end": 41.0,
      "text": "You literally can't."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.0,
      "end": 44.0,
      "text": "Our age gap is like 12 months,"
    },
    {
      "start": 44.0,
      "end": 45.0,
      "text": "which is basically a year."
    },
    {
      "start": 45.0,
      "end": 46.0,
      "text": "That's my family."
    },
    {
      "start": 46.0,
      "end": 47.0,
      "text": "I know."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.0,
      "end": 48.0,
      "text": "Basically a year."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.0,
      "end": 49.0,
      "text": "And we could get married."
    },
    {
      "start": 49.0,
      "end": 51.0,
      "text": "So, then we could be related."
    },
    {
      "start": 51.0,
      "end": 52.0,
      "text": "That is easy."
